## 📌 Overview

The AI Career Intelligence Platform provides an intelligent assistant for job seekers by combining modern web technologies with AI.

Users can:

- 🤖 Ask career-related questions
- 📄 Improve resumes
- 💼 Prepare for interviews
- 🎯 Receive personalized career suggestions
- ⚡ Get instant AI-powered responses

